1
00:00:00,670 --> 00:00:02,070
Good evening, excellence…

2
00:00:02,670 --> 00:00:03,790
Test yourself:

3
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:05,220
three things in front of you…

4
00:00:05,410 --> 00:00:07,160
A WhatsApp message from the work group

5
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:09,240
A customer complaint to solve today

6
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:10,930
and next month's plan

7
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:12,130
Where do you start?

8
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:14,460
Most of us… reply to WhatsApp first!

9
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:15,830
This is where the

10
00:00:15,830 --> 00:00:16,860
Eisenhower Matrix comes in

11
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:18,140
Eisenhower Matrix

12
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:19,270
Just two questions…

13
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:19,980
Important?

14
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:20,830
Urgent?

15
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:22,180
Important and urgent:

16
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:23,160
do it now…

17
00:00:23,230 --> 00:00:24,450
like the complaint

18
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:25,970
Important, not urgent:

19
00:00:25,970 --> 00:00:26,830
schedule it…

20
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,580
like the plan

21
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:30,120
Urgent, not important:

22
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:30,910
delegate it…

23
00:00:30,910 --> 00:00:32,890
like most WhatsApp messages

24
00:00:33,010 --> 00:00:34,650
Neither important nor urgent:

25
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:35,930
drop it from your day

26
00:00:36,210 --> 00:00:37,860
And Stephen Covey says:

27
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:39,570
the most effective people

28
00:00:39,770 --> 00:00:42,430
spend their time in the second quadrant:

29
00:00:42,790 --> 00:00:44,790
the important that isn't urgent

30
00:00:44,950 --> 00:00:45,970
Remember it this way:

31
00:00:46,090 --> 00:00:47,460
Not everything urgent… is important.

32
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:49,730
And you? Which quadrant eats your day?

33
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:50,930
Tell me in the comments

34
00:00:51,150 --> 00:00:52,370
See you tomorrow…

35
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:53,650
on Masaa Al-Tamayoz
